<title>GREECE: Athens bourse clears Baby Land Toys IPO.</title>
<headline>Athens bourse clears Baby Land Toys IPO.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange approved the initial public offering prospectus of Baby Land Toys SA for listing on its small-cap parallel market, it said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Baby Land Toys which sells toys and baby care goods will issue 810,000 new common shares in its IPO. Proceeds will finance the expansion of its sales network and a new store in Vari, Attica, the bourse said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
